  "description": "<p><strong>Are you tired of the same old boring fashion choices? Want to add some humour and fun to your wardobe? Look no further than Unique Designs UK! With uniquely british humour on our affordable threads, we can help you spice up your outfits!</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Unique Designs UK is one of you! Ever since the pandemic, the team have been trying to get our In-house Piccaso's work on the most affordable clothing possible. Based in Liverpool, Unique Designs UK are trying to buck the trend and give people a giggle without having their pants down. Believe us we know the feeling of having to remortgage the house because of a shopping day!&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<div tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Who's Spicing up Your Outifits?\">\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>Our designs are created by a team of talented artists and graphic designers who have a passion for taking the mick and causing some controversy; they'll aim to do that with almost every design! Our aim is to rep threads that link to our favourite films and tv shows and provide you with the chance to buy some without feeling it where it hurts, your wallet! Sit back and delve into our collections of Movie loving paradise, we do this as a pastime!</strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Media gallery\"><button id=\"ModalClose-template--15841830863008__main\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
